@startuml Sum_Ssfm_LNMConfigurationErrors_Manager
top to bottom direction
skinparam linetype ortho

legend top left
    "Sum_Ssfm_LNMConfigurationErrors_Manager"

**Interfaces Legend**
   //II152 //: ERRH_ExecutionStatus
   //ri126 //: LNM_ERRH_NotConfigured<XXX>
   //ri127 //: LNM_ERRH_NetConfigListNotProgrammed<n>
   //ri129 //: LNM_ERRH_MissingCalibration<XXX>
   //II178 //: Debounced Error
   //II157 //: DisableDTCs
   //II179 //: Undebounced Error
   //pi140 //: ERRH_NotConfigured<XXX>_SetEventStatus
   //pi141 //: ERRH_NetConfigListNotProgrammed<n>_SetEventStatus
   //pi143 //: LNM_ERRH_MissingCalibration<XXX>_SetEventStatus
   
endlegend

note top of EC
It reads notifications from the LNM about LIN Responder Device Not Configured Errors and it asks the DEM to set/clear DTC accordingly.
It reads notifications from the LNM about LIN Device Missing Calibration Error and it asks the DEM to set/clear the DTC accordingly.
It reads notifications from the LNM about Network Configuration List Not Programmed Errors and it asks the DEM to set/clear the DTC accordingly.
end note


component [Sum_Ssfm_LNMConfigurationErrors_Manager] as EC{
    portin ri126
	portin ri127
	portin ri129
	portout pi140
	portout pi141
	portout pi143

	[Sum_Ssfm_LNMConfigurationErrors_Manager]  as E
}

   interface II152
   interface II178
   interface II179
   interface II157


  ri126 -> E
  ri127 -> E
  ri129 -> E
  II152 -> E
  II178 -> E
  II157 -> E
  E -> pi140
  E -> pi141
  E -> pi143 
  E -> II179  


@enduml
